# The collectors' network. A plain bridge, because a collector is the one process
# that must talk to a provider -- SimpleFIN is a cloud API -- while the deployment
# that consumes the result must not.
#
# This network is deliberately separate from agent-general.network even though
# both have egress: the general deployment holds hosted-model authority, and a
# finance collector has no business being on the same segment as the proxy that
# carries the provider key. The collector reaches the internet and nothing else;
# it has no route to either deployment's network, and neither deployment can
# dial it.
[Unit]
Description=Smortress agent collector network

[Network]
